  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Initial release of the Nalix core runtime infrastructure.\n- Implemented high-performance MiddlewarePipeline for asynchronous packet processing and orchestration.\n- Introduced PacketDispatchChannel for reliable, observable packet routing and execution management.\n- Optimized PacketContext for low-allocation metadata and state propagation through pipelines.\n- Added support for NetworkBufferMiddlewarePipeline to streamline low-level buffer manipulations.\n- Refined PacketDispatchOptions with granular concurrency and synchronization controls.",
